      "sourceTextSha256": "1a822a2a4afdd3e4979682404c0d65efcd11d842260561c16fc5b27b2cca7a54",
      "text": "One of two boat excursions is planned for today: North Seymour with Las Bachas beaches, or South Plaza with Punta Carrión. The island is confirmed after booking; both excursions are not included together.\n\nLunch on board, return to the hotel and a free evening. Accommodation: Hotel Fiesta 3★. Meals: breakfast and lunch.",
